* Munakata Taisha Shrine rice crackers
* Happiness Mochi

=== Transportation ===
By bus
* Hetsunomiya - From {{ill|lt=Kagoshima Main Line|Q1187520|qid=Q1187520|1=Kagoshima Main Line}}/{{ill|lt=Togo Station|Q5359652|qid=Q5359652|1=Tōgō Station}}, take {{ill|lt=Nishitetsu Bus|Q11629843|qid=Q11629843|1=Nishitetsu Bus}} Route 1 bound for Kamiminato Hatoba and get off at "Munakata Taisha-mae". It takes 10 minutes.
* Nakatsumiya/Okitsumiya Yohaisho - From Togo Station on the Kagoshima Main Line, take the Nishitetsu bus bound for Kamiminato Hatoba and get off at the last stop (20 minutes). From {{ill|UNKNOWN|lt=Kamiminato Fishing Port|1=UNKNOWN}} to {{ill|lt=Oshima Port (Fukuoka Prefecture)|Q30933915|qid=Q30933915|lt=Oshima Port|1=Port of Oshima}}, it takes 15 minutes by the {{ill|lt=Munakata Municipal Ferry|Q11451853|qid=Q11451853|1=Munakata Municipal Ferry}} passenger ship, or 25 minutes by ferry. 5 minutes walk (800 meters) from Oshima Port to Nakatsunomiya.

If you have your own car, it is 16 kilometers from {{ill|lt=Kyushu Expressway|Q1060803|qid=Q1060803|1=Kyushu Expressway}}{{ill|lt=Wakamiya Interchange|Q1575782|qid=Q1575782|1=Wakamiya interchange}} to Hetsunomiya and 19 kilometers to Kamiminato Fishing Port. Alternatively, from the same {{ill|lt=Koga Interchange|Q1577981|qid=Q1577981|1=Koga interchange}}, it is 15 kilometers to Hetsunomiya and 17 kilometers to Kamiminato Fishing Port. From Kamiminato Fishing Port, take the Munakata Municipal Ferry to Oshima Port, 400 meters to Nakatsu-miya Shrine, and 2.3 kilometers to Okitsu-miya Yohaisho.

